    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-tasks",
        "moduleId": "analysis-tasks",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "需求分析的任务",
        "markdown": "教材指出，需求分析阶段的主要任务是对现实世界要处理的对象（组织、部门、企业等）进行详细调查，在了解现行系统的概况和确定新系统功能的过程中，收集支持系统目标的基础数据及其处理方法。需求分析的结果是否准确地反映了用户的实际要求，将直接影响到后面各个阶段的设计，并影响到设计结果是否合理和实用。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000403"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "需求分析"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7793,
              "lineEnd": 7796,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "ec75a354f45b1a43e7c5085809aefefd58b5b355fb1746dd52b92cf8f7a04bad"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000404"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "需求分析的任务"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7797,
              "lineEnd": 7810,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2923a12463615bbaf44662ed36cbf3299e688b1e8177559e477ad3b15358e8a2"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-methods",
        "moduleId": "analysis-tasks",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "需求分析的方法",
        "markdown": "教材介绍了需求分析的常用方法，包括：调查组织机构情况、调查各部门业务活动情况、协助用户明确对新系统的各种要求（信息要求、处理要求、完整性与安全性要求）、确定新系统的边界。常用的分析工具包括数据流图（DFD）和数据字典。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000405"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "需求分析的方法"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7811,
              "lineEnd": 7847,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/1832a81d0b5d4f1b7d76acbc7de3d1f3fb015e8a35bf43098da44015206e2e58.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "88ff717f9c4611887afc09728685d4aadcc9b8e9f13700b6c02d2f557c35eadc"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-dd-intro",
        "moduleId": "data-dictionary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "数据字典",
        "markdown": "教材定义：数据字典是系统中各类数据描述的集合，是进行详细的数据收集和数据分析所获得的主要成果。数据字典在需求分析阶段建立，在数据库设计过程中不断修改、充实和完善。它在数据库设计中占有很重要的地位。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000406"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "数据字典"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7848,
              "lineEnd": 7853,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "6b06b2292e06ad73924a6f08dd12ba125dd9fcd129180fa4372e0c444c7d78ae"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-data-item",
        "moduleId": "data-dictionary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "数据项",
        "markdown": "教材说明，数据项是不可再分的数据单位。对数据项的描述通常包括：数据项名、含义说明、别名、类型、长度、取值范围、与其他数据项的逻辑关系等。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000407"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "数据项"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7854,
              "lineEnd": 7865,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "fd44f128e2fd01d655e69f411bdcd6df3481e737a362b269d4f9f832be3035fc"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-data-structure",
        "moduleId": "data-dictionary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "数据结构",
        "markdown": "教材说明，数据结构反映了数据之间的组合关系。一个数据结构可以由若干个数据项组成，也可以由若干个数据结构组成，或由若干个数据项和数据结构混合组成。对数据结构的描述通常包括：数据结构名、含义说明、组成等。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000408"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "数据结构"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7866,
              "lineEnd": 7871,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "983da280e424814909533b3856cd1b46b05f70fbcf490df8acbcf5babf4f09e8"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-data-flow",
        "moduleId": "data-dictionary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "数据流",
        "markdown": "教材说明，数据流是数据结构在系统内传输的路径。对数据流的描述通常包括：数据流名、说明、流出过程、流入过程、组成（数据结构）、平均流量、高峰期流量等。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
